A||||5||Nashco||Who's going to the Woodward Cruise?||||1||
Z||000000||Nashco||08-16-2001||02:38 AM||||Hey everybody,<P>I'm getting all psyched about Woodward coming up and just wanted to see if there were going to be some fieros there.<P>I'm going to be there from Saturday afternoon to Sunday afternoon, and I was hoping maybe I could hook up with somebody there and check out their cars.  I'm bringing my 88 GT.  I didn't get the front suspension rebuilt yet (I have all the parts but have to wait to use somebody else's tools on the balljoints/control arms), and my exhaust is loud as hell...but that doesn't mean I can't bring it <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Well, let me know if you're going, what you're driving, and when you were planning on going.  Maybe several of us could meet up, park together, and enjoy the show together!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
Z||000001||Tigger||08-16-2001||09:15 AM||||That's this weekend?  I'll get back with you in the next day or so.<P>Brent||||reg||1
Z||000002||Nashco||08-16-2001||06:27 PM||||Hmm...that's it?  I know there has to be about 40 members within a couple hours, of which about 15 could come.  It's the best car show there is, because you don't have to pay and you get to see them run...come on guys and gals, it's a good time!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
Z||000003||fix||08-16-2001||09:42 PM||||When is it?  This weekend?  Unfortunately my fiero isn't road ready just yet, but my brother was thinking about taking his 71 Chevelle down there and if he goes I might tag along in hopes of spotting some fieros.  ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Shaft||08-16-2001||11:50 PM||||You know I'll be there in the hopes of seein some fieros. I got tuff to do on Sat, so I'll probably only be out on Sun and maybe even Fri night. Maybe I'll see ya there Bryce||||reg||1
Z||000005||Nashco||08-17-2001||09:53 AM||||Hmm...I'm a little disappointed; I had just *assumed* there would be several people going, but I've only heard of a couple, and nobody is bringing their Fieros.  How about you Tigger?  Saturday night...ought to be a blast.  I guess this is a last shot at finding some people <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||9
